Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,追溯到1835年 萨姆埃尔·柯尔特造了一把奇特的枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in 1835, Samuel Colt made a special gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:23.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,据说这把枪可以杀死任何东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say this gun can kill anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,柯尔特已经死了 看起来那个恶魔很可能…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Colt is gone and it seems pretty damn likely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在背后操纵着一切{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the demon is behind all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:39.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,十字路口是契约签订的地方 要出卖你的的灵魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crossroads are where pacts are made. Selling your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,仪式是这样的… 你要把你自己的照片埋进去 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rituals like this. You put your photo in the mix, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:46.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我清楚你的一切 迪恩·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about you, Dean Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:49.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我在寻找一个最棒的 最聪明的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for the best and brightest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我是萨姆 - 我是扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Sam. - I'm Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是一场竞赛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:57.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们这群疯狂的孩子之中 只有一个… 可以活着离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one of you crazy kids is gonna make it out of here alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:02.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你坚强 你聪明{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are tough, smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:05.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你接受了很好的训练 萨姆 你是我的最爱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're well trained, Sam. You're my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam. - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, look out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:11.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:25.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,带这个回来给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brought you this back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 谢谢 我很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:01:59.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你应该吃点东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should eat something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:02.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说了我很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:14.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我恨我提起这个 我真的恨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to bring this up, I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你难道不认为我们 也许是时候…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't you think maybe it's time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:21.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埋了萨姆吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we bury Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:25.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:34.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们也许可以… - 什么 烧了尸体{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we could maybe... - What, torch his corpse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:37.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还不到时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:42.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要你跟我走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:44.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我哪里也不去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 拜托 - 你难道不能让我静一会儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean, please. - Would you cut me some slack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得你不应该一个人 仅此而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't think you should be alone, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我得承认 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta admit I could use your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:57.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,某些大事件要来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something big is going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:02.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 如同世界末日般的 - 那就终结吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- End-of-the-world big. - Well, then let it end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会这样吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:08.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为不会？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:12.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为我得到的还不够多吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I've given enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为我付出的还不够多吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I've paid enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:19.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我受够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所有的一切{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:27.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你知道怎样才好的话… 转身离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you knew what's good for you, turn around and get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:31.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:40.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:46.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你离开吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:03:59.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道我会在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where I'll be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:40.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你好 扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:45.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我… 我在做梦 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I'm dreaming, aren't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我手上有一个天才{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a genius on my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恭喜 扎克 你是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, congratulations, Jake, you're it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,坚持到最后的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last man standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:57.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,美国偶像{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American Idol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:04.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我得承认 你不是我下注的那匹马 但是 我仍然会给你机会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to admit, you weren't the horse I was betting on but still, I gotta give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,去过了 见过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been there. Done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你把我卷入的这一切…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you put me through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:14.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把我弄到那个地方 让我杀了那些人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragging me to that place, making me kill those people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:17.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都是"选美比赛"的一部分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All part of the beauty pageant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,扎克 我需要一个最强的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake, I needed the strongest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:21.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,需要我做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Needed me for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:26.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有一大张刺激的清单给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I got a laundry list of tasty things for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:29.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要做的唯一的事… 就是醒过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing I'm gonna do, is wake up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,击倒你 然后亲手杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hunt you down and kill you myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:35.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 其他人试过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, others have tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不容易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:42.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,相信我 扎克 你想成为一个很棒的小兵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, Jake, you wanna be a good little soldier here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我不想呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I'm not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你是个坏小兵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're a bad little soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:49.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你那亲爱的老母亲…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that dear old mom of yours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:52.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那可爱的小妹妹…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that adorable little sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:56.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我保证他们都能活的足够长来…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make certain that they both live long enough...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:06:01.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,了解他们自己内脏的嚼劲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to know the chewy taste of their own intestines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:07.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 扎克 我没有胡说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Jake, I'm not bluffing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:15.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你要我做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像我说的 天赋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said. Genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道 在我们小时候…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when we were little...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你5岁还没到…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you couldn't have been more than 5...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:39.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就开始提问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just started asking questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们怎么没有妈妈？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come we didn't have a mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么我们总是搬家？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we always have to move around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:51.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd Dad go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:54.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,离开一段时间的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd take off for days at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我记得我求你说 别再问了 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember I begged you, "Quit asking, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 你不会想知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you don't wanna know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只想让你当一个孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted you to be a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:08.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就再当久一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for a little while longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我一直试着保护你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always tried to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,保障你的安全{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸甚至没有告诉我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad didn't even have to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这永远是我的职责 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just always my responsibility, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像我一个任务{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like I had one job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有一个任务…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而我搞砸了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I screwed it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我吹牛了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为了这个 对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for that, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜我就是这样的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我让我所爱的人失望{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let down the people I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我令爸爸失望{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let Dad down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在我猜可能也要让你失望了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I guess I'm just supposed to let you down too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:22.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我怎么能？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样我怎么能活的下去？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to live with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:43.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快点 已经好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,露出你的脸 你这个婊子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show your face, you bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:06.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,放松点 甜心 你会吵醒邻居的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, sugar, you'll wake the neighbors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:15.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见到你真是太棒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is so, so good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说真的 看看你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it. Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:27.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,令你的家人都死了 孤单的活在世上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone and got your family killed. All alone in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:29.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这太美妙了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你得让我离开下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, you're gonna have to give me a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有时候你得停下来 闻闻玫瑰的花香{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you gotta stop and smell the roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我应该把你直接送回地狱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should send you straight back to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:43.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你应该 但你不会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you should. But you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道为什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:52.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,追随父亲的脚步 你想做笔交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Following in Daddy's footsteps. You wanna make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:55.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小萨姆的起死回生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Sammy, back from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:57.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 出卖你自己的灵魂？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let me guess, you're offering up your own soul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:00.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有数百个其他的… 想要出手的恶魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a hundred other demons who'd love to get their hands on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:04.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这都取决于你 你所要做的就是带萨姆回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's all yours. All you gotta do is bring Sam back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给我10年时间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give me 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,10年 然后你就来拿我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years and then you come for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:11.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你一定是在开玩笑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:14.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是与你给其他人 一样的条件{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same deal you give everybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:15.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不是其他人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not everybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我为什么要给你任何东西？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I wanna give you anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:26.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,留着你的破灵魂吧 总之 是太残败了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your gutter soul, it's too tarnished anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:31.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 9年 - 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nine years. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:35.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 8年 - 你继续 我会一直说不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eight. - You keep going, I'll keep saying no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:39.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 5年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:42.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,5年后 我的帐到期{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years, then my bill comes due.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:44.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是我最后的出价 5年否则就没交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my last offer. Five years or no deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:53.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么就没交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then no deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:58.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:03.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,确保在萨姆腐烂之前 把他埋掉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you bury Sam before he starts stinking up the joint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是大特价 所有东西必须出手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fire sale and everything must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I have to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:20.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,首先 别卑躬屈节的 低三下四的男人很倒胃口{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, quit groveling. Needy guys are such a turnoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:25.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,瞧…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:29.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不应该这样做 我会陷入很多麻烦之中{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I shouldn't be doing this. I could get in a lot of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我能说什么？我对你没办法 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what can I say? I got a blind spot for you, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:37.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就像个… 小狗崽 和你玩真是太有趣了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like a puppy, you're just too fun to play with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:41.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:44.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你会带他回来吗 - 我会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll bring him back? - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:49.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为我是如此一个好人 我会给你一年时间 只有一年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And because I'm just such a saint, I'll give you one year and one year only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:54.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是重点是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.19,0:12:58.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你试图逃避或者躲藏的话… 那么交易就结束{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you try and welch or weasel your way out, then the deal is off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:01.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆就会死… 他立即就会变回腐烂的臭肉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam drops dead, he's back to rotten meat in no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:05.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:08.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比你爸爸做的交易更好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a better deal than your Dad ever got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:13:59.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨弥{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:02.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank God. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃… 迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 伙计 我只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I'm sorry, man, I'm just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:15.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是见到你起来太高兴了 就是这样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy to see you up and around, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 来 坐下 - 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, sit down. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:21.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 我怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what happened to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你记得什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:27.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我… 我看到你和博比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I saw you and Bobby and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:33.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我感觉到疼痛 这种极度的疼痛就像… 就像 极端的 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I felt this pain. This sharp pain, like white hot, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:37.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后… 然后你跑向我… 就这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you started running at me and that's about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 那… 那个小子 从背后刺伤了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that kid stabbed you in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:44.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你失了很多血 很严重而且持续了很久{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost a lot of blood. You know, it was pretty touch and go for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是迪恩 你… 你不可能 治疗那么严重的伤口{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Dean, you can't patch up a wound that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 博比能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Bobby could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不管如何 那个小子是谁 - 他的名字是扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was that kid anyway? - His name's Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:55.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你抓到他了吗 - 没有 他消失在树林中了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get him? - No. He disappeared in the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们得找到他 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta find him, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:59.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且我发誓 要把那个狗杂种撕成碎片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I swear, I'm gonna tear that son of a bitch apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:02.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,放松点 范·达姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Easy, Van Damme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:05.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你刚刚醒过来 好吗？我们吃点东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just woke up. Let's get you something to eat. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:06.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想吃点东西吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want something to eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:08.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我饿死了 来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starving. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:11.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后你们就出现了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's when you guys showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:12.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那太可怕了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可怜的安迪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Andy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔说他只想让 我们中的一个或者走出去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demon said he only wanted one of us to walk out alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:21.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他告诉你的 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And he told you that? - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:24.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他出现在梦中 - 他告诉你其他什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Appeared in a dream. - He tell you anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:29.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 没有 就那些 没其他的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, that was it, nothing else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:34.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我不明白的是 迪恩 如果恶魔只想要我们中的一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, what I don't get, Dean, is if the demon only wanted one of us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么为何我和扎克都能离开？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then how did Jake and I both get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:40.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 他们留你等死 我肯定他们以为结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I mean, they left you for dead. I'm sure they thought it was over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:46.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在那个黄眼有扎克了 他会对他怎么样？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that Yellow Eyes has Jake, what's he gonna do with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:49.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:52.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是无论是什么 我们得阻止他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whatever it is, we gotta stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:55.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 好吗？ 你需要休息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hold on, all right? You need to get your rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们有时间 - 不 我们没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got time. - No, we don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 大海还没沸腾呢 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, oceans aren't boiling, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:03.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,雾不是从天上落下来的 我们要先让你恢复体力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frogs aren't raining from the sky. Let's get you your strength back first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你问过路边旅馆了吗？他们知道什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, did you call the Roadhouse? They know anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:08.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩… 怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:20.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,路边旅馆被烧平了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Roadhouse burned to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:22.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,阿什死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:25.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,艾伦也许… 也有很多其他的猎人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably, Ellen, a lot of other hunters too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:30.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 恶魔 - 是 我们认为是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Demons? - Yeah, we think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:33.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们认为原因是阿什发现了些什么 - 他发现了什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We think because Ash found something. - What did he find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:35.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,博比正在调查{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby's working on that right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:38.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 走吧 博比离我们就几个小时的路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, come on then. Bobby's only a few hours away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:40.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停下 萨姆 停 该死的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Stop, Sam, stop. Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:45.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你差一点就死在… 我是说 我要…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost died in there. I mean, what would I have-?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就更好的照顾好自己 就更好一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you just take care of yourself for a little bit, huh? Just for a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:55.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:13.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 博比 - 嗨 博比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Bobby. - Hey, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:15.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:17.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见到你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:19.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,又站起来了… 真好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}see you up and around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你救活我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks for patching me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别客气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:32.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆好点了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Sam's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:34.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们现在回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're back in it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么… 你了解到什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:44.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我找到些东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:46.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我不确定到底是什么意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not sure what the hell it means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:51.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔的征兆…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demonic omens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像该死的 涨潮落潮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a frigging tidal wave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,牲畜死亡 电闪雷鸣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cattle deaths, lightning storms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:57.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,凭空出现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've skyrocketed from out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:02.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都在这周围{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,除了一个地方以外…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for one place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 南怀俄明州 - 怀俄明州？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Southern Wyoming. - Wyoming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 那个地区完全干净 无际可寻{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that one area's totally clean. Spotless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 基本就像… - 什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's almost as if... - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔在包围那儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the demons are surrounding it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:16.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你知道为什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:20.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 目前为止 我毫无头绪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, and by this point my eyes are swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:23.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 你能看看吗？也许你能发现些 我发现不了的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you take a look at it? Maybe you can catch something I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好 当然{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:30.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 迪恩 卡车里还有更多的书…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Dean. I got some more books in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:32.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,帮我拖进来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me lug them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:35.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:45.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你这个白痴傻蛋 你做了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid ass. What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你做了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你做了笔交易… 为了萨姆 是不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a deal. For Sam, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们给你多久 - 博比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long they give you? - Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:56.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,多久{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:02.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该死的 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:08.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是我们为什么 要找到那个黄眼狗杂种{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we gotta find this yellow-eyed son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是为什么我要亲手杀了他 我现在没有什么 可以输的了 对吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm gonna kill him myself. I mean, I got nothing to lose now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我真想杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could throttle you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:17.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,提前把我送到下面去？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And send me downstairs ahead of schedule?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:24.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们姓温彻斯特都怎么了 恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you Winchesters, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:29.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你 你爸爸 你们都渴望把自己送到地狱去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, your dad, you're both just itching to throw yourselves down the pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是我的问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸把我带回来的 博比 我甚至都不该在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad brought me back, Bobby, I'm not even supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:38.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,至少这样… 才能更加有意义 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least this way, something good can come out of it, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像是我的生命能更有意义{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like my life can mean something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么 之前没有吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, and it didn't before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:45.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你对你自己 有这么低劣的评价吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you got that low an opinion of yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:47.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是那么白痴吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you that screwed in the head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:52.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不能让他死 博比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't let him die, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:58.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是我的兄弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:04.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你的兄弟会怎么想… 当他知道你会下地狱？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is your brother gonna feel when he knows you're going to hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:09.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当你知道你爸爸为了你 这么做的时候你什么感觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you feel when you knew your dad went for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:11.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不能告诉他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:15.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你开枪打死我 无论你做什么… 但是拜托不要告诉他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take a shot at me, whatever you gotta do. But please don't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:38.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,艾伦？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:40.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,艾伦 哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:57.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,博比 这真的需要吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby, is this really necessary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是一杯圣水 不会伤害你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a belt of holy water. Shouldn't hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:09.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在 威士忌吧 如果你不介意的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey now, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:15.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 艾伦 发生什么了 - 你怎么逃出来的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellen, what happened? How'd you get out? - I wasn't supposed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:18.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我本不该的 我本该和其他人一起在那儿的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was supposed to be in there with everybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:21.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我们去买椒盐卷饼了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we ran out of pretzels, of all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:24.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是该死的运气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was just dumb luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,总之 那时候阿什打过电话 声音很惊恐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, that's when Ash called, panic in his voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:36.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他告诉我去看一下保险箱 然后电话就断了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me to look in the safe. Then the call cut out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:40.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当我回去的时候 已是漫天大火{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time I got back, the flames were sky high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:44.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所有人都死了 我离开不过15分钟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody was dead. I couldn't have been gone more than 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 艾伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,许多好人死在了那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lot of good people died in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:52.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而我活了下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:54.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,幸运的我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:21:59.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,艾伦 你提到一个保险箱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen, you mentioned a safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一个我们保存在 地下室的隐蔽保险箱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hidden safe we keep in the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:02.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔拿到里面的东西了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons get what was in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:04.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:13.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怀俄明州{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wyoming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.16,0:22:15.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:20.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么 你找到什么了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you got something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:25.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不止一点儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:32.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,每一个X代表一个 被废弃的边境教堂 都是19世纪中期的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each of these X's is an abandoned frontier church, all mid-19th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,全都是萨姆埃尔·柯尔特建造的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all of them built by Samuel Colt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆埃尔·柯尔特 那个造猎鬼枪的萨姆埃尔·柯尔特？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Samuel Colt? The demon-killing, gun-making Samuel Colt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:39.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:41.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有更多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:45.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他在教堂间建造了 互相连接的私人铁路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He built private railway lines connecting church to church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:49.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恰好就形成了这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That just happens to lay out like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:54.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我这不是我想的那样 - 那是一个恶魔之束缚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me that's not what I think it is. - It's a Devil's Trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:59.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一个100平方英里的恶魔之束缚 - 太有才了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A hundred-square-mile Devil's Trap. - That's brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔无法跨越铁路线{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron lines, demons can't cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:04.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我从没听说过如此宏伟的东西 - 没有人听过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never heard of anything that massive. - No one has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:07.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这么多年没有一条线路损坏吗 它还在工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these years none of the lines are broken? I mean, it still works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:09.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是肯定的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:12.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 所有那些博比找到的前兆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know? - All those omens Bobby found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.47,0:23:15.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些恶魔 他们肯定游荡在周围 但是却进不去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the demons, they must be circling and they can't get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:18.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 他们在尝试 - 为什么 那里面有什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, well, they're trying. - Why? What's inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.23,0:23:22.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是我一直在调查的 然后…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I've been looking for. And, uh, there's nothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.27,0:23:25.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,里面除了正中间的 一个古老的牛仔公墓以外… 其他什么都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except an old cowboy cemetery right in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:28.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 一个公墓 有什么如此重要？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What's so important about a cemetery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:29.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,柯尔特在保护些什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Colt trying to protect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:33.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 除非… - 除非什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, unless... - Unless what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:36.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果柯尔特并不是尝试 要把恶魔们关在外面呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Colt wasn't trying to keep demons out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:38.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果他只是要把 某些东西关在里面呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if he was keeping something in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:40.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 令人鼓舞的想法 - 是啊 你认为呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, that's a comforting thought. - Yeah, you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:43.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们能做到吗博比 他们能进去吗 - 这东西太强大了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could they do it? Could they get inside? - This thing's so powerful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:46.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你几乎需要一个原子弹 才能摧毁他们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd practically need an A-bomb to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:48.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,纯种恶魔想要穿越进去 绝对没门儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way a full-blood demon gets across.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:52.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:54.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我知道谁可以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know who could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:28.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你好 扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:32.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 一路上愉快吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did you have a nice trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:34.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我来了 我做了你叫我做的 现在怎样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here. I did what you asked. Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.59,0:24:37.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那条路过去50英里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty miles, thataway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:40.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那有一个公墓 一个地窖 你要为我打开它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cemetery, a crypt. You gotta open that for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.93,0:24:42.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得你能做到吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you can manage that, sport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:45.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 你和你那变态的命令见鬼去吧 你自己去做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Screw you and your freaky orders. Go do it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:47.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我不能 我不能过去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can't. I can't go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.98,0:24:49.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 还不能 - 为什么不能？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not yet. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:54.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我就是不能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:57.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是如果你 为我打开那个地窖 你将会需要一把钥匙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you're gonna open that crypt for me, you're gonna need a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:01.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一把枪 - 哦 这可不仅仅是一把枪 扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A gun? - Oh, this isn't just any gun, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:06.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是这宇宙中唯一的一把… 能够杀掉我的枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the only gun in the whole universe that can shoot me dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:09.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that so? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:11.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这儿 拿着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:20.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我的… 我对这无法预料的转折 还真惊讶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my...I'm shocked at this unforeseen turn of events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:23.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 扎克 扣下扳机吧 尽你所能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Jake. Squeeze that trigger. Be all you can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:26.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这一切都会结束 你的生活都会恢复正常{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This'll all be over. Your life can go back to normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:28.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然了 因为你的擅离职守 军队也不会再要你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Course, the Army won't take you back because you're AWOL.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.98,0:25:32.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我肯定你能在工厂里 找回你的旧工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm sure you could get your old job at the factory back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:37.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是然后 从另一方面来说… 你和你家人剩下的日子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then on the other hand, the rest of your life and your family's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:40.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,会是富有 甜蜜 健康 富足{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could be money and honey, health and wealth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:43.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,每一天都是像冰淇淋一般甜蜜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day is ice cream Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:45.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而你所需要做的只是 那么一点点小事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all you gotta do is this one little thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.04,0:25:49.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 为什么是我 - 哦 扎克 一定要是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why me? - Oh, Jake, it's gotta be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:53.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我等你已经等了很久了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for you for a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.34,0:25:56.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是我的首领 你打开那个地窖 你就会得到你的军队{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my leader. You open that crypt and you will have your army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.93,0:26:00.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你在说的是世界末日吗 - 不 不是末日{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're talking about the end of the world. - No, not the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:02.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而是开始… 一个更好的世界{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beginning. A better world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:04.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里你的家庭会被保护起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where your family will be protected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.81,0:26:06.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有更多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:08.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们会是皇室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be royalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:12.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小伙子 你有了一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy boy, you'll have the chance to get in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:15.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如此令人激动的好机会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the ground floor of a thrilling opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.36,0:26:17.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么说 由你自己决定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say? It's your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.87,0:26:31.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attababy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:59.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你好 扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy, Jake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.87,0:27:11.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:13.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你已经死了 我杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were dead. I killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:14.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:15.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 下一次完成任务{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, next time finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.13,0:27:17.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.09,0:27:20.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我完全割断了你的脊髓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut clean through your spinal cord, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.39,0:27:26.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不可能还活着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.14,0:27:32.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 好了 好好冷静下来 孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't be. - Okay. Just take it real easy there, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.85,0:27:34.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 如果我不呢 - 走着瞧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And if I don't? - Wait and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.86,0:27:40.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么 突然就变成男子汉了 你想怎么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you a tough guy all of a sudden? What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.15,0:27:41.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 杀了我 - 是有这想法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill me? - It's a thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:44.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有过机会的 但是你没能做到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your chance. You couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:45.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,同样的错误我不会犯两次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't make that mistake twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在笑什么呢 你这小贱人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you smiling at, you little bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.13,0:27:56.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 女士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.71,0:27:59.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,帮我做件事儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:02.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把枪指着你自己的脑袋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that gun to your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:14.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看吧 那个女孩艾娃是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that Ava girl was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:18.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一旦你投入进去 有好多种摄心术能学{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you give into it, there's all sorts of new Jedi Mind Tricks you can learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.90,0:28:21.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 让她走 - 射他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let her go. - Shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:24.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在你们开枪之前 可要弹掉你们身上她的头骨的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be mopping up skull before you get a shot off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:29.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所有人 把枪放下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody put your guns down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.33,0:28:32.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,除了你 甜心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except you, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.81,0:28:54.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.88,0:29:25.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:26.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.93,0:29:28.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.25,0:30:03.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 不 - 博比 这是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - Bobby, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:05.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是地狱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.43,0:30:08.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,藏起来 快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:37.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 刚刚到底发生了什么 - 那是恶魔之门 该死的地狱之门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell just happened? - That's a Devil's Gate, a damn door to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:47.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们去关上那个门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we gotta shut that gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.72,0:30:58.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果恶魔给了扎克这个…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the demon gave this to Jake...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:01.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么也许…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then maybe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.24,0:31:09.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小孩子不该玩爸爸的枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys shouldn't play with Daddy's guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:27.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.35,0:31:37.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我一会儿再来处理你 性急的家伙 我为你骄傲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get to you in a minute, champ. But I'm proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:39.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道你很有种{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you had it in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.52,0:31:46.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,坐下的咒符{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit a spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:54.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 迪恩… 我得感谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Dean, I gotta thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.99,0:31:59.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果没有交易 恶魔无法复活人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, demons can't resurrect people unless a deal is made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.33,0:32:02.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道 很艰难 让你很白痴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, red tape, it'll make you nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.17,0:32:06.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是托你的福 萨姆又回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But thanks to you, Sammy's back in rotation. Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.54,0:32:08.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没有指望那个 但我很高兴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I wasn't counting on that but I'm glad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比起扎克我更喜欢萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liked him better than Jake anyhow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.84,0:32:14.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你有没有听到这句话…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, you ever heard the expression:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.93,0:32:18.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"如果一笔交易太棒了以至于 无法相信 可能那就是真的"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If a deal sounds too good to be true, it probably is"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.35,0:32:20.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你称这为好的交易？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call that deal good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.35,0:32:23.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比你父亲的那个要好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, it's a better shake than your Dad ever got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.19,0:32:26.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you never wondered why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.61,0:32:28.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我为你感到惊讶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.82,0:32:33.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的意思是… 你看见你弟弟对扎克 做了什么 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you saw what your brother just did to Jake, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:35.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那还挺无情的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was pretty cold, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.53,0:32:42.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有多确定…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How certain are you that what you brought back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.41,0:32:45.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你带回来的是100%的萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is 100 percent pure Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.46,0:32:51.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在你经历过的一切之后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After everything you've been through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:53.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你所有的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you've...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:58.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们人都知道 死了就是死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You of all people should know that what's dead should stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.47,0:33:02.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,总之…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:04.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks a bunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.31,0:33:07.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道我让你活着是有原因的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I kept you alive for some reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.36,0:33:08.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,总之 直到现在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until now anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.40,0:33:13.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是不会成功的如果… 没有你可悲的自卑…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have done it without your pathetic self-loathing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.86,0:33:18.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,自我毁灭倾向… 为你的家庭牺牲自己{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}self-destructive desire to sacrifice yourself for your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.78,0:36:08.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,任务总算完成了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, check that off the to do list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.33,0:36:12.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你做到了 - 我不是一个人做到的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did it. - I didn't do it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.04,0:36:17.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为爸爸真的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Dad really...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.09,0:36:20.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为他真的是 从地狱爬上来的吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think he really climbed out of hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.59,0:36:23.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,之前门开了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A door was open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.55,0:36:29.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果谁会如此顽固的话…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anyone's stubborn enough to do it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.77,0:36:31.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就一定是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'd be him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.81,0:36:38.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为他现在会在哪儿？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think he is now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:42.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.57,0:36:47.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有点不敢相信 迪恩 我的意思是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of can't believe it, Dean. I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.33,0:36:53.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们的一生 所有的一切… 都为了这一刻…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our whole lives, everything, has been prepping for this. And now, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:59.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有些不知道该说些什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.51,0:37:04.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:15.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是为了我们的母亲…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was for our mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:18.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.70,0:37:31.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道 当扎克看到我的时候… 就像看到了鬼一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when Jake saw me it was like he saw a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.12,0:37:38.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 见鬼的 我听见他说的了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, hell, you heard him, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.21,0:37:41.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他说他杀了我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:44.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很高兴他说错了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad he was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:46.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我认为他没有 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he was, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当我被刺了以后发生了什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?After I was stabbed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.43,0:37:56.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我已经告诉你了 - 不是每件事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I already told you. - Not everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.69,0:38:00.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们刚杀了一个魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, we just killed the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.40,0:38:04.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们能庆祝一下吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we celebrate for a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.57,0:38:10.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我死了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:12.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:15.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你出卖了自己的灵魂来救我 就像爸爸为你做的一样？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you sell your soul for me? Like Dad did for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.71,0:38:17.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托 没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:22.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉我真相{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.63,0:38:28.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 告诉我真相 - 萨姆…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean, tell me the truth. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:39.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有多久？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.07,0:38:47.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,1年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.74,0:38:51.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有1年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got one year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:55.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不该这么做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.50,0:38:59.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这样做呢 - 别生我的气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How could you do that? - Don't get mad at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.08,0:39:02.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别这么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.42,0:39:06.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我必须这么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.59,0:39:09.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我必须得照顾你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to look out for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:12.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的工作 - 你认为我的工作是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's my job. - And what do you think my job is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.85,0:39:17.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你一次又一次的救我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You saved my life over and over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:21.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你牺牲了一切来救我 你难道不认为 我也会为你这样做吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you sacrifice everything for me. Don't you think I'd do the same for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.86,0:39:25.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是我的大哥{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my big brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:29.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有任何事我不会为你做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing I wouldn't do for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:36.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不管代价是什么 我要把你救回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't care what it takes. I'm gonna get you out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:41.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜这次我要救你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess I gotta save your ass for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.13,0:39:44.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.42,0:39:46.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:50.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,黄眼也许已经死了 但却有很多穿过了那门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow-Eyed Demon might be dead but a lot more got through that gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.13,0:39:52.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你认为有多少？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:54.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一百{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.55,0:39:57.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许200 是一支军队{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe 200. It's an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.43,0:40:00.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他释放了一支军队{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's unleashed an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.85,0:40:05.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,希望你们已经准备好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope to hell you boys are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.19,0:40:06.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为战争才刚刚开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the war's just begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.40,0:40:11.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:22.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们有活儿干了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we got work to do.{\r}
